{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33381","headline":"和陆鲁望白菊 · 司马都","name":"和陆鲁望白菊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耻共金英一例开，素芳须待早霜催。\n绕篱看见成瑶圃，泛酒须迷傍玉杯。\n映水好将苹作伴，犯寒疑与雪爲媒。\n夫君每尚风流事，应爲徐妃致此栽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马都","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33381.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33381","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}